From 72bb34d6d67c2bc14720c77e2ad7eff6b89d360f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: paul-heyse <paul@heyse.io>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 07:47:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lctx: expose collectors and located native exit and terminal
 observations

Rebase the minimal embedding visibility patch on 1.4.0-dev.3, retire obsolete annotation exposure, and add query-scoped owned normal/error exit and qualified terminal observations. Native reachability, hover traces and diagnostics remain unchanged.

Tested 2026-10-03: pinned-nightly release State/Transaction/Answers harness passed 6 exit and 6 terminal controls, invalid-location and unforced-variable controls, before/after query parity, and byte-identical unmodified-tag inference/hover/diagnostic parity. No product qualification run.
